 # Ray Point Sampling
 ## Overview
-Ray Point Sampling generates query points along camera rays for volume rendering by discretizing the ray segment between near and far clipping planes using a fixed step distance [S1, unofficial]. It performs the actual coordinate generation and masking after ray-box intersection, differing from its parent [Ray-Bounding Box Intersection and Sampling Preparation](2364-ray-bounding-box-intersection-and-sampling-preparation.md) [G]. It uses deterministic, structured grid spacing rather than the stochastic sampling of [Random Point Sampling in Bounds](3914-random-point-sampling-in-bounds.md) [G].
+Ray Point Sampling generates query points along camera rays for volume rendering by discretizing the ray segment between near and far clipping planes using a fixed step distance [S1, unofficial]. It performs coordinate generation and bounding-box masking after ray-box intersection, differing from its parent [Ray-Bounding Box Intersection and Sampling Preparation](2364-ray-bounding-box-intersection-and-sampling-preparation.md) [G]. It uses deterministic, structured grid spacing rather than the stochastic sampling of [Random Point Sampling in Bounds](3914-random-point-sampling-in-bounds.md) [G].
